     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Vるところ: just before; Vているところ: in progress; Vたところ: just after.",
     "texto": [
      "The verb form before «ところ» fixes the moment of the action. «たところ» can also introduce a result discovered by trying something.",
